# Commit message template for the @involvex/yt-dlp fork.
#
# This repo carries two histories, so match the style to what you changed:
#   - yt_dlp/, devscripts/, .github/, test/  ->  upstream yt-dlp style: [ie/site] Description (#PR)
#   - src/, scripts/, package.json, *.test.ts  ->  Conventional Commits: fix(npm): Description
#
# Lines starting with # are comments and are stripped by git.
# Lines left blank are kept. Delete the guidance that does not apply.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- wrapper-only
# type(scope): imperative summary under ~72 chars
#
# Explain the root cause, not just the diff. Note breaking changes with a
# "BREAKING CHANGE:" footer. See CONTRIBUTING.md#commit-message-conventions.
#
# fix(npm): ship dist/ in tarball and correct bundled binary resolution

# ------------------------------------------------------------------- upstream
# [scope] Capitalised imperative description (#PR)
#
# [ie/<site>] Short description of the extractor change (#12345)
# [utils] `function_name`: Describe the behavioural change (#12345)
# [build] Bump <dependency> to <version> (#12345)
# [cleanup] Misc cleanup

# ------------------------------------------------------------------- releases
# Release <YYYY.MM.DD>
# v<YYYY.MM.DD[.rev]>

# ------------------------------------------------------------------- trailers
# Closes #<issue>
# Co-authored-by: Name <email>